  "title": "United States: TotalEnergies Pursues its Gas Value Chain Integration by Acquiring Producing Assets in the Anadarko Basin",
  "summary": "Paris, September 29, 2025 – TotalEnergies has signed an agreement with Continental Resources to acquire a 49% interest in natural gas producing assets, owned and operated by Continental Resources in the Anadarko Basin, Oklahoma. This acquisition of low-cost and long-plateau assets, well connected to Henry Hub through existing midstream infrastructure, further strengthens TotalEnergies’ integration across […]",
